{"title":"백작가의 사생아가 결혼하면","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=mVbTF/hAJq9qcEux/wv2jjd6Quh9vsmU96OZD21&filename=th3","synopsis":"\"공작가와 결혼해라, 라리트 브루마이어.\"\n\n천대받고 구박받는 인생인 백작가의 사생아 라리트.\n그녀는 태생부터 고귀한 이복언니를 대신하여,\n전쟁터에서 죽어버린 유령 공작가에 시집가게 된다.\n\n다만, 라인하르트 공작가는 반역죄로 인해 모든 재산이 압류되었으며,\n대신 신부로 가게 된 라리트가 향한 곳은 황실의 넒은 아량으로\n남겨진 외딴 산속에 있는 낡은 별장이다.\n\n하지만 평생 눈칫밥만 먹던 라리트에게 결혼은 절호의 기회!\n지긋지긋한 집을 떠나 드디어 생긴 나만의 집!\n\n창창한 홀로서기 라이프가 시작되나 싶었지만,\n늦은 밤, 죽은 줄 알았던 남편이 살아 돌아오는데...?\n\n웹소설 <백작가의 사생아 결혼하면> 웹툰화☆","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":247,"change":{"type":"down","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":282,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":291,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":230,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":185,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":200,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":288,"change":{"type":"down","amount":88}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":267,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":276,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":253,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":223,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":277,"change":{"type":"down","amount":54}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":213,"change":{"type":"up","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":289,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":283,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":243,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":240,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":260,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":254,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":285,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":251,